WEBVTT

01:41.440 --> 01:45.970
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.660 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 20]

01:49.430 --> 01:50.710
Zhang.

01:51.950 --> 01:52.680
Zhang.

01:53.560 --> 01:54.509
Zhang!

01:54.759 --> 01:56.039
Zhang!

01:56.530 --> 01:58.289
Don't leave me behind.

01:59.759 --> 02:00.920
If I'm alone,

02:01.040 --> 02:02.350
I'd rather die!

02:02.590 --> 02:03.920
It's all my fault.

02:04.120 --> 02:06.200
Let the Heavenly Way punish me,

02:06.230 --> 02:07.870
Zhang.

02:09.630 --> 02:10.750
Zhang.

02:16.920 --> 02:18.590
Zhang.

02:29.060 --> 02:30.440
Meng Zhang iwa willing to bear

02:30.470 --> 02:31.750
all heavenly punishment for Mr. Liu,

02:32.470 --> 02:34.000
but Mr. Liu's obsession runs too deep.

02:34.240 --> 02:35.150
He doesn't want to live on in disgrace.

02:36.240 --> 02:37.430
He has harmed so many people.

02:38.010 --> 02:39.240
He deserves his punishment.

02:40.490 --> 02:42.420
If the evil being hadn't influenced him,

02:43.150 --> 02:44.750
things might not have turned out this way.

02:50.340 --> 02:50.930
Even Grandmaster,

02:50.960 --> 02:52.310
who had reached the Transcenence Realm

02:52.840 --> 02:54.560
couldn't avoid being affected by the Spirit Spring.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.870
We still need to quickly find a way

02:57.150 --> 02:57.960
to help Master

02:58.030 --> 02:59.840
return the Spirit Spring to the netherworld for peace of mind.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.590
You all helped Meng Zhang.

03:02.910 --> 03:04.000
I have no way to repay you.

03:04.780 --> 03:06.410
This is my reverse scale as the Green Dragon.

03:06.710 --> 03:08.360
It's used to craft the Heavenly Book.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.150
Even mortals

03:10.590 --> 03:11.800
can use it to glimpse

03:11.800 --> 03:13.280
a fleeting vision of the future.

03:13.870 --> 03:15.430
What has already happened

03:15.560 --> 03:16.680
cannot be undone.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.750
But if the next life can be foreseen,

03:19.310 --> 03:21.960
it may help you avoid calamities and disasters.

03:22.590 --> 03:23.470
You all,

03:23.910 --> 03:24.870
please take care.

03:25.250 --> 03:25.850
Heavenly Book.

03:39.970 --> 03:41.480
[Modest and Receptive]

05:36.360 --> 05:37.620
Master, what did you see?

05:40.750 --> 05:41.360
Ranran,

05:41.560 --> 05:42.480
you haven't touched it yet, have you?

05:43.870 --> 05:44.430
There's no need.

05:45.090 --> 05:46.520
It doesn't matter what the Heavenly Book says.

05:47.120 --> 05:47.990
One's fate belongs to oneself.

05:48.120 --> 05:49.240
In the end, we must walk our own path.

05:49.920 --> 05:50.600
I won't look at it.

05:57.060 --> 05:58.070
Our business here is finished.

05:58.930 --> 05:59.850
Once we've rested and regrouped,

06:00.240 --> 06:01.190
we'll return to Mount Wester.

06:01.950 --> 06:03.120
-Yes, Master.
-Yes, Master.

06:16.830 --> 06:18.480
Since finding the Spirit Spring,

06:18.870 --> 06:20.720
Master has been a bit off.

06:21.950 --> 06:24.040
With the Heavenly Bottle temporarily sealing the Spirit Spring,

06:24.390 --> 06:25.510
Master should

06:25.870 --> 06:27.600
not be in any immediate danger, right?

06:28.000 --> 06:28.560
Ranran.

06:31.100 --> 06:31.720
My soldiers

06:31.750 --> 06:32.920
have almost fully recovered.

06:33.190 --> 06:34.240
We're preparing to set off now.

06:35.240 --> 06:35.800
Mr. Yu,

06:36.240 --> 06:36.920
take care then.

06:37.920 --> 06:38.630
Actually, I came

06:39.190 --> 06:40.190
to take you with me.

06:40.680 --> 06:41.870
Don't you want to go to the capital?

06:44.170 --> 06:45.450
I do want to go to the capital

06:45.480 --> 06:46.310
to have a look,

06:46.800 --> 06:47.680
but my body

06:48.220 --> 06:49.830
and spiritual power

06:50.070 --> 06:50.950
are still too weak.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.600
I can't leave Mount Wester yet.

06:58.720 --> 06:59.830
If you're unwell,

07:00.100 --> 07:00.870
then you should return to the capital

07:00.870 --> 07:01.660
with me even more.

07:02.310 --> 07:03.040
I can find you

07:03.040 --> 07:03.680
the best doctors.

07:04.160 --> 07:05.680
I can ensure that you're healthy and worry-free.

07:07.310 --> 07:08.600
Mr. Yu, there's no need to worry.

07:08.920 --> 07:10.120
It's just that my heart is unstable.

07:10.190 --> 07:10.950
If I cultivate well

07:11.120 --> 07:12.390
and form my Golden Core, everything will be fine.

07:13.830 --> 07:14.950
An unstable heart...

07:15.950 --> 07:17.070
Ranran fell from

07:17.310 --> 07:18.630
the Reincarnation Tree before 18 years.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.510
Could this be the reason why

07:20.690 --> 07:22.160
Su Yishui insisted on bringing Ranran

07:22.190 --> 07:23.040
to cultivate in Mount Wester?

07:23.960 --> 07:25.280
Su Yishui said that after you form your Golden Core,

07:25.310 --> 07:26.040
everything will be fine?

07:29.090 --> 07:30.280
After I gain more experience,

07:30.630 --> 07:31.830
I should be able to build my Foundation.

07:31.990 --> 07:33.560
Then the Golden Core stage won't be far off.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.390
How can I let you stay by his side

07:36.390 --> 07:37.159
for so long?

07:38.560 --> 07:39.070
Ranran,

07:39.950 --> 07:40.830
do you know that soon

07:40.850 --> 07:41.890
it will be the once-every-19-years

07:41.920 --> 07:42.870
Marrow-Cleansing Pool Trial?

07:44.360 --> 07:45.480
Marrow-Cleansing Pool?

07:45.800 --> 07:46.190
Yes.

07:46.920 --> 07:47.800
Hundreds of years ago,

07:48.330 --> 07:48.970
a great savior

07:49.000 --> 07:50.000
chanced upon a pool of spiritual power

07:50.020 --> 07:50.930
on Heavenly Meridian Mountain.

07:51.510 --> 07:52.920
Bathing in it could transform one's body,

07:53.070 --> 07:53.800
greatly increasing spiritual power.

07:54.270 --> 07:55.159
So after he attained ascension,

07:55.190 --> 07:56.360
he specially opened up this place,

07:56.510 --> 07:57.510
naming it the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

07:57.950 --> 07:59.240
He left it as a blessed land

07:59.260 --> 08:00.350
for future cultivators.

08:00.870 --> 08:01.990
But this Marrow-Cleansing Pool

08:02.360 --> 08:03.430
opens once every 19 years.

08:03.870 --> 08:04.750
Among all Heavenly Sect disciples,

08:04.750 --> 08:05.680
only those who compete

08:05.870 --> 08:06.870
and take first place

08:07.190 --> 08:07.800
will have the chance

08:07.830 --> 08:09.070
to enter the pool and cleanse their marrow.

08:10.120 --> 08:10.950
So you're saying

08:11.360 --> 08:13.040
if I win the Marrow-Cleansing Pool Trial,

08:13.340 --> 08:14.710
my spiritual power can advance?

08:14.870 --> 08:15.310
Yes.

08:16.310 --> 08:17.750
Then you'll be able to form your Golden Core, finish your training,

08:18.190 --> 08:19.120
and leave Su Yishui.

08:20.050 --> 08:21.460
[Natural Residence]

08:40.120 --> 08:41.789
The spell formation set has been triggered.

08:44.390 --> 08:45.120
Xi'er!

08:45.390 --> 08:46.600
Xi'er, what's wrong? Xi'er!

08:47.000 --> 08:47.550
Xi'er!

08:59.910 --> 09:01.030
The might of heaven is awe-inspiring.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.440
Empyrean Bone Sacrifice!

09:07.570 --> 09:08.800
Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation?

09:48.270 --> 09:49.750
My Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation

09:50.240 --> 09:51.150
may not be as powerful as it was

09:51.150 --> 09:52.750
when the four great Heavenly Sects' masters gathered

09:53.080 --> 09:54.960
to control the power of nine sacred relics,

09:55.480 --> 09:56.720
but it's still enough

09:56.750 --> 09:58.080
to completely decimate you.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.390
Master,

10:05.670 --> 10:06.360
my body

10:06.390 --> 10:07.790
feels like it's being drained!

10:44.390 --> 10:45.150
The Black Dragon Jade Pendant?

10:45.960 --> 10:46.960
It's Su Yu.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.290
Why is Su Yu here?

10:49.720 --> 10:50.600
The formation isn't complete yet.

10:50.860 --> 10:52.120
You must stop now!

10:52.600 --> 10:53.450
That's not possible.

10:53.790 --> 10:54.750
I promised that today,

10:54.920 --> 10:56.200
everyone here would die.

10:56.790 --> 10:58.550
How can I go back on my word?

11:19.400 --> 11:20.120
The formation is broken.

12:04.320 --> 12:04.910
Master!

12:08.840 --> 12:09.480
Master!

12:09.720 --> 12:10.270
Ranran!

12:18.480 --> 12:18.910
Ranran!

12:19.320 --> 12:20.150
Ranran, are you alright?

12:21.550 --> 12:22.690
It was Mr. Zeng's

12:22.720 --> 12:23.870
protective armor that saved me.

12:29.840 --> 12:31.150
Su Yishui, have you gone mad?

12:31.870 --> 12:33.080
The formation had clearly been broken.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.550
Why didn't you stop?

12:34.910 --> 12:35.910
Do you realize that Ranran

12:35.910 --> 12:37.320
almost died by your hand just now?

12:37.870 --> 12:39.600
If anything had happened to her,

12:40.350 --> 12:41.820
I would never forgive you.

12:43.030 --> 12:43.750
Master,

12:44.320 --> 12:46.080
I just suffered some minor injuries.

12:46.760 --> 12:47.970
Were you alright earlier?

12:59.720 --> 13:00.480
Master?

13:07.360 --> 13:08.600
I have suffered a great loss of spiritual power.

13:08.900 --> 13:10.030
It's unwise to take any more risks.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.600
Every injustice has its perpetrator.

13:14.000 --> 13:14.940
This was all her idea.

13:15.240 --> 13:16.360
If you want to settle scores, do it with her!

13:19.240 --> 13:19.960
Su Yishui,

13:20.120 --> 13:21.120
don't be so arrogant.

13:27.080 --> 13:27.670
Resentment Liquid!

13:28.000 --> 13:28.440
You—

13:28.910 --> 13:29.440
Yes.

13:30.440 --> 13:31.670
I've been secretly controlling

13:31.690 --> 13:33.320
the Resentment Liquid in your body.

13:33.800 --> 13:35.010
If you had behaved yourself,

13:35.030 --> 13:36.340
I wouldn't have touched the Resentment Liquid.

13:37.000 --> 13:37.950
You brought this upon yourself.

13:39.440 --> 13:40.240
I was wrong.

13:40.510 --> 13:41.630
I was wrong, Su Yishui.

13:41.690 --> 13:43.000
I won't dare to do this again.

13:43.720 --> 13:44.720
For Qingge's sake,

13:44.960 --> 13:46.150
please forgive me.

13:46.670 --> 13:47.360
In your previous life, your sister

13:47.390 --> 13:48.390
catered to your every whim,

13:48.410 --> 13:49.240
protected, and indulged you.

13:49.960 --> 13:50.840
But I'm not her.

13:51.150 --> 13:52.270
I won't be soft-hearted.

13:52.690 --> 13:53.880
Although I can't kill you,

13:54.710 --> 13:56.000
I have countless ways

13:56.030 --> 13:57.120
to make you wish you were dead.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.000
Su Yishui.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.120
I know

14:02.320 --> 14:03.320
you are the real Demon's child.

14:05.080 --> 14:05.870
In the previous life,

14:06.320 --> 14:07.790
Qingge took the blame for you.

14:09.000 --> 14:09.960
If you don't stop now,

14:10.410 --> 14:12.080
I'll reveal this secret to the world.

14:12.930 --> 14:13.810
You think I care

14:13.840 --> 14:14.510
if others know?

14:16.480 --> 14:17.720
You're not afraid of this,

14:18.690 --> 14:20.410
but don't you care about Xue Ranran?

14:32.110 --> 14:33.000
I already found out.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.390
Your disciple, Xue Ranran,

14:36.000 --> 14:37.120
is my sister,

14:38.000 --> 14:38.750
Mu Qingge,

14:38.840 --> 14:39.440
right?

14:42.960 --> 14:44.480
You don't care if the Heavenly Sects find out

14:44.510 --> 14:45.840
about your identity as the Demon's child and seek revenge,

14:46.350 --> 14:47.750
but Xue Ranran is different.

14:48.550 --> 14:50.030
She's your disciple now

14:50.920 --> 14:52.160
and has little spiritual power.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.390
When the time comes,

14:53.620 --> 14:55.380
she will surely become the target of everyone's attacks,

14:55.750 --> 14:56.900
never knowing peace in her life.

14:57.670 --> 14:58.720
If at that time,

14:59.440 --> 15:01.150
you're also in deep trouble,

15:01.690 --> 15:03.490
will you still be able to protect her?

15:07.200 --> 15:08.020
Su Yishui,

15:08.870 --> 15:10.270
neutralize my Resentment Liquid immediately

15:10.570 --> 15:12.090
or I'll draw my sword and end my life.

15:12.750 --> 15:14.630
Qingge and I are connected by the Soul-Devouring Lock.

15:14.870 --> 15:15.510
If I die,

15:15.870 --> 15:16.550
she dies too.

15:17.720 --> 15:18.870
With her going down with me,

15:19.670 --> 15:20.480
it'll be worth it.

15:26.360 --> 15:27.870
If I can make the Reincarnation Tree bear fruit once,

15:27.890 --> 15:28.870
I can do it a second time.

15:29.440 --> 15:30.240
But you won't have

15:30.270 --> 15:31.150
another chance to come back to life.

15:32.080 --> 15:32.750
Go ahead and try.

15:35.000 --> 15:36.480
Making the Reincarnation Tree bear fruit once

15:36.720 --> 15:38.320
requires you to use up half a Golden Core.

15:39.020 --> 15:40.570
Do you still have enough Golden Cores

15:40.600 --> 15:41.270
to spare?

15:44.120 --> 15:44.600
What's wrong?

15:45.510 --> 15:46.390
Did I guess correctly?

15:47.510 --> 15:48.940
Wanting to resurrect my sister

15:49.130 --> 15:50.090
isn't that easy,

15:50.120 --> 15:50.630
right, Su Yishui?

15:52.080 --> 15:53.320
I can neutralize the Resentment Liquid.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.600
But I want you to make a soul oath.

15:55.870 --> 15:57.290
You must not reveal Ranran's and my identities

15:57.320 --> 15:58.030
to anyone else.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.720
Play your role as Mu Qingge well.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.360
If you break this oath,

16:02.790 --> 16:03.840
may heavenly lightning strike you down

16:04.000 --> 16:05.240
and your soul be forever destroyed.

16:06.870 --> 16:08.670
How dare you make me swear such a vicious oath!

16:13.480 --> 16:15.030
Before that drop of dew hits the ground,

16:16.030 --> 16:17.400
you still have a chance to make the oath.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.660
Otherwise, I'll kill you first.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.320
At worst, I can give up the remaining half

16:21.320 --> 16:21.870
of my Golden Core too!

16:27.080 --> 16:27.790
I swear!

16:28.390 --> 16:29.030
I will never reveal

16:29.030 --> 16:30.330
Xue Ranran's and yours identities.

16:30.550 --> 16:31.830
If I do, may heavenly lightning strike me down

16:31.870 --> 16:32.900
and my soul be forever destroyed.

16:39.000 --> 16:39.670
Su Yishui,

16:40.320 --> 16:41.320
you madman!

16:41.790 --> 16:42.630
To neutralize the Resentment Liquid,

16:43.200 --> 16:44.330
follow me to Mount Wester.

17:10.160 --> 17:10.680
Your Highness.

17:11.720 --> 17:12.609
I've brought the wound medicine.

17:16.310 --> 17:17.230
You're wounded too.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.310
Let's tend to your wounds first.

17:39.720 --> 17:41.400
Su Yishui almost seriously injured you,

17:42.160 --> 17:43.270
and now he's disappeared

17:44.590 --> 17:46.000
without an explanation.

17:47.400 --> 17:48.510
The way he was just now...

17:52.920 --> 17:53.480
Never mind.

17:55.200 --> 17:55.800
I think you should

17:55.830 --> 17:56.720
leave with me.

17:57.550 --> 17:59.160
Master must have discovered something,

17:59.680 --> 18:00.310
so...

18:01.160 --> 18:02.480
He won't abandon us.

18:08.160 --> 18:08.790
Mr. Yu.

18:10.110 --> 18:10.550
Your Highness,

18:11.000 --> 18:12.070
the army has urgent matters

18:12.200 --> 18:13.000
that can't be delayed any longer.

18:17.200 --> 18:17.830
Ranran,

18:20.090 --> 18:20.790
since you're still unwilling

18:20.790 --> 18:21.830
to come with me this time,

18:23.070 --> 18:24.160
I won't force you.

18:26.000 --> 18:27.110
After you form your Golden Core and complete your training,

18:28.200 --> 18:29.000
we'll discuss it again.

18:30.520 --> 18:32.200
I must leave today.

18:35.510 --> 18:36.810
Take good care of yourself.

18:41.240 --> 18:41.920
Mr. Yu.

18:44.200 --> 18:44.830
Take care.

19:09.640 --> 19:10.170
Your Highness.

19:13.440 --> 19:14.000
Your Highness.

19:24.030 --> 19:24.590
Your Highness,

19:25.350 --> 19:26.200
we were delayed here

19:26.680 --> 19:27.440
for too long.

19:27.840 --> 19:28.970
The pills left by the Exotic Pavilion

19:29.000 --> 19:29.590
have all been used up.

19:29.920 --> 19:30.880
I'm afraid the poison in your body

19:30.960 --> 19:31.960
can no longer be suppressed.

19:32.700 --> 19:33.560
Don't make a fuss about it.

19:34.310 --> 19:35.270
Return to the capital immediately.

19:36.240 --> 19:36.720
Yes.

19:37.240 --> 19:37.790
Your Highness,

19:38.070 --> 19:38.750
there's one more thing.

19:40.060 --> 19:41.270
The collapsed waterway here

19:41.540 --> 19:42.750
has unexpectedly been cleared.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.110
Excellent.

19:48.350 --> 19:49.480
I can't wait anymore.

19:50.350 --> 19:51.000
Let's depart.

20:05.010 --> 20:05.800
Could Master

20:05.830 --> 20:07.070
be in some kind of trouble?

20:08.510 --> 20:09.070
Senior,

20:09.480 --> 20:10.350
take good care of Xi'er.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.310
I'll go out and have a look.

20:12.270 --> 20:12.880
Alright.

20:15.960 --> 20:16.480
Master,

20:16.510 --> 20:17.030
Master!

20:17.240 --> 20:18.000
Are you alright?

20:20.750 --> 20:21.920
Long time no see, Xue Ranran.

20:23.110 --> 20:24.200
Master Mu.

20:26.160 --> 20:27.480
I happened to be passing by.

20:28.070 --> 20:29.510
I sensed that Shui was nearby,

20:29.920 --> 20:30.830
so I came to check on him.

20:33.070 --> 20:34.790
Master, you suddenly left just now.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.720
Was it to look for Master Mu?

20:49.680 --> 20:51.070
I have stabilized Xi'er's primordial spirit.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.970
She still needs to take medication and rest for several days

20:53.000 --> 20:53.720
to recover.

20:54.480 --> 20:55.350
Let's return to Mount Wester first.

20:55.950 --> 20:57.000
Yes, Master.

20:57.310 --> 20:58.400
What about Master Mu?

20:58.920 --> 21:00.000
I'll go with you all.

21:01.550 --> 21:03.160
Mr. Yu just left.

21:03.440 --> 21:05.110
Won't you go catch up with him?

21:06.070 --> 21:07.240
I naturally want to spend more time

21:07.270 --> 21:08.000
with Shui.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.270
Master!

21:21.720 --> 21:23.000
You didn't look

21:23.200 --> 21:24.070
very well earlier.

21:24.720 --> 21:26.160
Were you affected by the Spirit Spring?

21:30.330 --> 21:31.000
Master!

21:35.960 --> 21:36.920
This matter doesn't concern you.

21:37.190 --> 21:38.240
I can handle it myself.

21:38.410 --> 21:39.300
Don't ask any more questions.

21:43.030 --> 21:43.400
You,

21:43.920 --> 21:44.880
come with me.

21:52.210 --> 21:53.080
Can't Grandmaster

21:53.110 --> 21:54.350
fly by herself?

21:56.550 --> 21:57.030
Ranran,

21:57.310 --> 21:58.440
then I'll take Xi'er away first.

21:58.690 --> 21:59.670
Be careful on your own.

22:07.940 --> 22:09.240
Who on earth wanted to

22:09.240 --> 22:10.200
set up a formation here to kill us?

22:13.400 --> 22:15.110
The Alcohol Immortal is proficient in rune cultivation.

22:16.030 --> 22:17.510
Perhaps he can help find out something.

22:38.170 --> 22:39.070
-Master.
-Guardian.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.400
Clean up the room

22:41.400 --> 22:42.110
next to mine.

22:42.300 --> 22:43.860
Master Mu will be staying at Mount Wester for a few days.

22:46.420 --> 22:47.310
-Yes.
-Yes.

22:56.070 --> 22:56.640
Bring the high-quality

22:56.640 --> 22:57.640
soul-transferring pills from the alchemy hall.

22:58.070 --> 22:59.160
Help Xi'er take them daily.

22:59.880 --> 23:00.830
Yes, Master.

23:02.840 --> 23:03.460
Follow me.

23:21.400 --> 23:23.350
You were in such a hurry to pull me away earlier.

23:23.960 --> 23:25.480
Were you worried that I might accidentally

23:25.680 --> 23:26.880
say something wrong?

23:29.310 --> 23:30.640
Keep your mouth shut.

23:32.680 --> 23:34.230
I can keep my mouth shut,

23:35.950 --> 23:37.540
but can you control your heart?

23:42.160 --> 23:43.350
You're so guarded against me.

23:43.720 --> 23:44.550
What's the use?

23:45.640 --> 23:46.790
I saw everything earlier.

23:47.550 --> 23:48.350
You lost control

23:48.930 --> 23:50.270
and almost killed Qingge.

23:54.480 --> 23:55.510
You are the Demon's child,

23:56.480 --> 23:58.200
and now, you're carrying the Spirit Spring.

24:00.110 --> 24:00.920
Could it be

24:01.400 --> 24:02.200
that you're being influenced

24:02.200 --> 24:03.270
by the evil Spirit Spring again?

24:06.790 --> 24:08.550
But it's still several years

24:08.570 --> 24:09.700
before the netherworld's gate opens.

24:10.680 --> 24:12.590
As long as this Spirit Spring can't be returned

24:13.030 --> 24:14.470
and stays with you,

24:15.480 --> 24:16.400
who knows when

24:16.420 --> 24:17.620
you might lose control again

24:18.830 --> 24:19.960
and kill Qingge?

24:38.160 --> 24:39.070
How is Xi'er doing?

24:45.590 --> 24:46.350
I must catch

24:46.370 --> 24:47.450
the one who set up the trap to harm us

24:48.400 --> 24:49.790
and get revenge for Xi'er.

25:16.870 --> 25:18.830
If it can be implanted from the outside into the heart,

25:19.920 --> 25:21.480
then there must be a way to remove it.

25:49.070 --> 25:50.110
Why isn't it working?

25:50.720 --> 25:51.310
Why?

26:19.590 --> 26:26.200
[Carefree Pavilion]

26:27.590 --> 26:28.310
Mr. Yu Chen,

26:28.510 --> 26:29.200
is Master here?

26:29.880 --> 26:30.540
The Guardian is not here.

26:31.010 --> 26:31.890
Yesterday, the Guardian instructed me

26:31.920 --> 26:32.750
to tidy up the alchemy hall.

26:32.770 --> 26:33.820
He said he would prepare it for Mu Ran—

26:36.110 --> 26:37.110
Mu Qingge for alchemy today.

26:37.610 --> 26:38.520
He probably

26:38.960 --> 26:40.920
went to the alchemy hall early to start the furnace.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.440
Master actually

26:47.960 --> 26:49.400
went to start the furnace himself.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.880
She's about to build her Foundation.

27:09.880 --> 27:10.920
If she advances,

27:11.360 --> 27:11.970
won't my spiritual power

27:12.000 --> 27:13.110
be drained and decrease

27:13.110 --> 27:13.680
again?

27:13.990 --> 27:15.270
I can't let her succeed.

27:19.240 --> 27:20.550
Before advancing,

27:20.750 --> 27:21.750
one's true energy is unstable.

27:22.420 --> 27:23.900
It's the easiest to go astray at this time.

27:24.750 --> 27:26.200
I can't attack her,

27:27.410 --> 27:28.080
but if

27:28.110 --> 27:29.640
her own true energy goes haywire

27:30.030 --> 27:30.920
and something goes wrong,

27:32.310 --> 27:33.680
then it can't be blamed on me.

27:47.550 --> 27:48.110
Ranran.

27:51.310 --> 27:51.960
Master Mu.

27:52.350 --> 27:53.920
Bringing snacks to Shui?

27:55.480 --> 27:56.200
There's no need.

27:57.310 --> 27:58.960
His mind is all on me.

27:59.550 --> 28:01.200
He'll be refining pills for me in the coming days.

28:01.750 --> 28:03.270
He has no time for irrelevant people.

28:05.000 --> 28:05.890
You came here early in the morning

28:05.920 --> 28:07.440
just to brag about these things to me?

28:09.030 --> 28:09.550
Alright.

28:10.070 --> 28:10.590
I got it.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.000
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

28:13.830 --> 28:15.070
Did I expose

28:15.350 --> 28:16.480
those unspeakable thoughts

28:16.510 --> 28:17.270
of yours?

28:18.030 --> 28:19.070
Let me remind you,

28:19.830 --> 28:21.240
don't forget your place.

28:21.830 --> 28:22.750
Don't go coveting

28:22.750 --> 28:24.040
those you shouldn't.

28:30.830 --> 28:31.830
In his eyes,

28:32.140 --> 28:34.070
you're just a disciple he took in

28:34.440 --> 28:36.070
to pass his idle time.

28:36.790 --> 28:37.590
When he's happy,

28:38.070 --> 28:38.880
he'll dote on you.

28:39.720 --> 28:40.350
When he's bored,

28:40.680 --> 28:41.510
he'll discard you.

28:42.440 --> 28:43.480
Don't ever

28:43.550 --> 28:44.480
take yourself too seriously.

28:46.960 --> 28:47.790
Then tell me,

28:48.930 --> 28:50.210
people say Mu Qingge

28:50.240 --> 28:51.240
is obsessed with me.

28:52.030 --> 28:52.830
Is that true?

29:07.560 --> 29:08.410
Don't think I don't know

29:08.440 --> 29:09.070
what you're up to.

29:09.680 --> 29:10.920
If you can't let go of your delusions,

29:11.270 --> 29:12.480
I'll give you a hand.

29:12.960 --> 29:14.720
You saved Qingge and gave her a second life.

29:15.460 --> 29:17.060
Do you want to repeat the same mistakes?

29:38.790 --> 29:39.640
Master?

29:41.400 --> 29:42.480
Why were you so careless?

29:43.020 --> 29:44.030
You didn't even notice

29:44.030 --> 29:44.830
that you're about to build your Foundation?

29:45.550 --> 29:46.350
Master,

29:46.480 --> 29:47.050
I...

29:47.720 --> 29:48.270
Focus your mind,

29:49.200 --> 29:49.920
close off your five senses,

29:50.400 --> 29:51.160
eliminate distracting thoughts,

29:52.030 --> 29:53.070
and channel your energy to build your heart.

30:18.020 --> 30:19.020
The lightning tribulation has come.

31:34.960 --> 31:36.160
I just wanted to

31:37.400 --> 31:38.400
savor every moment

31:38.400 --> 31:39.680
with you before sealing the Spirit Spring.

31:41.070 --> 31:42.400
Even if the Ice Lotus Technique hurt me,

31:42.400 --> 31:43.070
so what?

31:45.640 --> 31:46.880
But now I realize

31:48.030 --> 31:49.480
that the drop of Spirit Spring in my heart

31:49.510 --> 31:50.240
wasn't completely erased.

31:53.880 --> 31:54.750
I won't allow myself

31:54.750 --> 31:55.480
to get close to you again.

32:34.540 --> 32:35.700
I've fallen from the Nascent Soul stage.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.400
Mu Qingge,

32:41.400 --> 32:42.130
were you born

32:42.160 --> 32:43.350
to oppose me?

32:44.880 --> 32:46.750
I'll make sure you won't have it easy.

33:18.560 --> 33:20.230
That was the Spirit Spring just now.

33:21.870 --> 33:22.580
Ling Xiao.

33:26.230 --> 33:27.680
Could you be the Demon's child?

33:28.070 --> 33:29.240
You still don't remember?

33:30.160 --> 33:30.710
No,

33:31.160 --> 33:32.680
I need to see clearly who you really are.

33:39.960 --> 33:41.510
What is this place?

33:48.790 --> 33:50.200
This is me from my past life?

33:51.110 --> 33:51.790
Ling Xiao.

33:53.510 --> 33:54.270
Ling Xiao?

33:55.440 --> 33:55.960
No,

33:56.680 --> 33:57.880
these are my memories.

33:58.510 --> 34:00.010
Could it be that I've reached the Foundation Phase

34:00.440 --> 34:01.340
and my spiritual power has increased,

34:01.510 --> 34:03.000
unlocking memories from my past life?

34:03.680 --> 34:05.000
I've moved from Ling Xiao's memories

34:05.160 --> 34:05.590
into

34:05.590 --> 34:06.790
my own memories.

34:07.830 --> 34:08.590
I never thought

34:09.360 --> 34:11.000
you'd venture into the netherworld.

34:17.960 --> 34:18.550
Ling Xiao,

34:19.320 --> 34:20.510
I've also entered the netherworld.

34:21.550 --> 34:22.920
What was I doing in the netherworld?

34:24.070 --> 34:25.760
Could my past life be connected to the Spirit Spring?

34:27.840 --> 34:29.030
What exactly is our connection?

34:30.440 --> 34:30.920
Ling Xiao,

34:31.489 --> 34:32.360
see if you can

34:32.360 --> 34:33.110
remember anything else.

34:49.969 --> 34:51.080
Why is everything so different

34:51.110 --> 34:52.230
from what I imagined?

34:54.110 --> 34:55.280
Who am I really?

34:57.960 --> 34:59.000
And who are you?

35:02.440 --> 35:03.320
This time,

35:03.840 --> 35:05.230
we miscalculated a bit.

35:06.110 --> 35:06.930
Su Yishui

35:06.960 --> 35:09.030
found the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring,

35:09.550 --> 35:11.670
but it didn't go as we planned.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.800
He wasn't possessed by the Spirit Spring again.

35:14.110 --> 35:14.760
However,

35:15.320 --> 35:16.360
as long as he still has

35:16.510 --> 35:18.230
that drop of Spirit Spring in his heart,

35:18.590 --> 35:20.070
everything can be managed.

35:21.510 --> 35:23.320
I have another plan.

35:24.880 --> 35:25.880
I know

35:26.150 --> 35:27.440
it's hard for you to accept it too.

35:28.670 --> 35:30.070
If you really are the Demon's child,

35:30.670 --> 35:32.320
yet you were deeply entangled with my past life

35:32.960 --> 35:34.710
and even split your spiritual soul to protect me,

35:36.050 --> 35:38.280
it's indeed quite complicated to process.

35:39.880 --> 35:41.410
No wonder Master was reluctant

35:41.430 --> 35:42.430
to tell me about my past life.

35:44.230 --> 35:45.670
You say you won't look for your soul owner anymore

35:45.800 --> 35:46.510
and you won't go back?

35:47.480 --> 35:48.070
That won't do.

35:48.400 --> 35:48.880
Ling Xiao,

35:49.560 --> 35:50.600
regardless of whether your soul owner is the Demon's child

35:50.630 --> 35:51.360
or whatever else,

35:51.480 --> 35:52.510
you are still my friend.

35:53.030 --> 35:54.800
Your kindness in protecting me all this way still stands.

35:54.920 --> 35:55.960
I will send you back.

35:56.920 --> 35:57.590
Besides,

35:58.000 --> 35:59.890
the Demon's child is just a regular person born

35:59.920 --> 36:01.280
at a special time, nothing more.

36:01.960 --> 36:02.970
Right or wrong, good or evil,

36:03.000 --> 36:03.880
I can discern it for myself.

36:05.190 --> 36:06.070
Moreover,

36:06.810 --> 36:08.610
I need to advance faster now.

36:10.030 --> 36:10.630
This way,

36:11.440 --> 36:12.360
I can find out

36:12.510 --> 36:14.480
how I entered the netherworld before

36:14.900 --> 36:16.780
and help Master return the Spirit Spring as soon as possible.

36:18.930 --> 36:20.600
The fastest way to advance...

36:21.480 --> 36:22.550
It opens once every 19 years.

36:23.150 --> 36:24.000
Among all Heavenly Sect disciples,

36:24.000 --> 36:24.920
only those who compete

36:25.070 --> 36:26.030
and take first place

36:26.410 --> 36:27.120
will have the chance

36:27.150 --> 36:28.280
to enter the pool and cleanse their marrow.

36:33.710 --> 36:34.150
Ranran.

36:35.510 --> 36:36.360
Mr. Zeng.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.000
Ranran,

36:41.550 --> 36:42.230
congratulations on

36:42.480 --> 36:43.360
successfully building your Foundation.

36:44.280 --> 36:45.840
Mr. Zeng, you've come to congratulate me so quickly.

36:46.230 --> 36:47.640
Since you've successfully built your Foundation,

36:47.670 --> 36:48.710
you should have

36:48.710 --> 36:49.590
a suitable weapon.

36:50.240 --> 36:51.160
The sword you used

36:51.190 --> 36:52.320
to defeat the Nine-Headed Kui'ao last time

36:52.400 --> 36:53.280
was indeed a divine weapon.

36:53.480 --> 36:54.320
That sword also acknowledges you.

36:54.920 --> 36:56.510
That's Mu Qingge's Qingming Sword, isn't it?

36:59.800 --> 37:01.320
I've already given the sword to Master for safekeeping.

37:01.750 --> 37:03.390
Master must cherish it very much.

37:04.810 --> 37:05.600
This sword has an owner.

37:05.920 --> 37:06.440
I don't want it.

37:08.230 --> 37:08.550
Alright,

37:08.960 --> 37:09.590
that's fine.

37:10.190 --> 37:11.190
I will custom-make

37:11.190 --> 37:12.230
a better one for you.

37:12.630 --> 37:13.320
Thank you, Mr. Zeng.

37:13.710 --> 37:14.630
You're so kind to me.

37:15.150 --> 37:15.670
However,

37:16.030 --> 37:16.440
I already

37:16.440 --> 37:17.710
have my own weapon.

37:23.810 --> 37:24.670
I want to call it

37:24.960 --> 37:25.480
Divine Tree.

37:26.550 --> 37:27.760
Someone once told me

37:28.830 --> 37:29.950
that planting a tree somewhere

37:30.740 --> 37:32.090
means you have a home there.

37:34.030 --> 37:35.320
Mount Wester will be your home from now on.

37:35.770 --> 37:36.410
You are no longer

37:36.440 --> 37:37.400
homeless.

37:43.150 --> 37:44.800
This Reincarnation Tree shares your life force.

37:45.340 --> 37:46.290
If you forge it into a weapon,

37:46.320 --> 37:47.070
there won't be anything

37:47.070 --> 37:47.760
more suitable for you.

37:48.800 --> 37:50.030
With your Formless Spirit Root,

37:50.280 --> 37:52.200
you should be able to make it transform more freely at will.

37:53.030 --> 37:54.150
With my current spiritual power,

37:54.510 --> 37:55.630
it's probably not possible.

37:56.190 --> 37:56.670
However,

37:57.150 --> 37:58.760
if I use spirit pills to supplement my power...

38:09.400 --> 38:09.970
Brilliant!

38:11.190 --> 38:12.400
Perhaps different spirit pills

38:12.700 --> 38:14.010
can give it different transformations.

38:18.420 --> 38:19.170
I'll try it next time.

38:26.390 --> 38:28.090
[Consonance Palace]

38:34.840 --> 38:35.480
Stiffly Su.

38:36.000 --> 38:37.150
What's going on with you?

38:37.670 --> 38:39.030
I couldn't stop you

38:39.110 --> 38:40.120
from falling in love before.

38:40.150 --> 38:41.360
Why the sudden change now?

38:42.000 --> 38:42.550
It's nothing.

38:43.000 --> 38:43.800
I think you're right.

38:44.190 --> 38:45.590
Don't give me that evasive nonsense.

38:47.440 --> 38:48.280
Why did you bring

38:48.280 --> 38:48.960
Mu Ranwu back?

38:49.710 --> 38:50.590
With all your mood swings,

38:50.590 --> 38:51.710
what will Ranran think?

38:52.230 --> 38:53.710
You must explain it clearly to me today.

39:00.670 --> 39:01.070
Hey,

39:02.360 --> 39:03.800
what can't you tell me?

39:04.880 --> 39:05.190
Alright.

39:06.630 --> 39:07.150
Let me guess.

39:08.000 --> 39:09.840
This must've started when you rescued Ranran

39:09.920 --> 39:11.320
from those bastards of the Scarlet Sect

39:11.320 --> 39:12.110
at the foot of Mount Cuiwei

39:12.190 --> 39:12.670
and couldn't suppress

39:12.670 --> 39:13.670
the violent energy inside you.

39:14.070 --> 39:14.960
I heard you lost control

39:14.960 --> 39:15.480
in Puxin Village too.

39:15.800 --> 39:16.510
It's related to this, right?

39:17.000 --> 39:18.480
So the Spirit Spring can still affect you.

39:24.510 --> 39:25.230
When I was young,

39:25.760 --> 39:27.400
a drop of Spirit Spring was planted in my heart.

39:28.150 --> 39:29.030
It has always been there,

39:29.550 --> 39:30.710
impossible to remove or eradicate.

39:31.280 --> 39:32.400
It resonates with the Spirit Spring.

39:33.360 --> 39:34.190
Before long,

39:34.550 --> 39:35.400
I won't be able to suppress it anymore

39:35.400 --> 39:36.320
or seal off the Spirit Spring.

39:37.190 --> 39:38.110
Are you saying

39:38.760 --> 39:40.190
you're afraid the Spirit Spring will possess you again?

39:41.710 --> 39:42.230
But

39:44.240 --> 39:45.880
there are still three years

39:46.110 --> 39:47.070
before the netherworld reopens.

39:47.320 --> 39:48.370
Can you hold out until then?

39:50.270 --> 39:51.110
I don't know,

39:52.080 --> 39:52.680
but I absolutely won't

39:52.710 --> 39:53.610
let myself be repossessed.

39:54.110 --> 39:55.070
We must quickly find another way

39:55.070 --> 39:56.150
to enter the netherworld.

39:57.110 --> 39:57.880
Is there any way?

39:58.630 --> 39:59.320
I haven't found one yet,

39:59.920 --> 40:01.110
but when Qingge entered the netherworld back then,

40:01.320 --> 40:02.710
it wasn't during the key opening time either.

40:03.070 --> 40:03.630
So there must be

40:03.630 --> 40:04.320
other ways.

40:04.600 --> 40:05.320
So that's why you're here,

40:05.320 --> 40:06.190
looking through these records.

40:08.620 --> 40:10.390
Is this also the reason

40:10.760 --> 40:11.710
why you pushed Ranran away?

40:13.680 --> 40:14.480
She can't be

40:14.480 --> 40:15.230
dragged down by me again.

40:16.280 --> 40:17.510
I can't keep her by my side anymore.

40:17.960 --> 40:19.110
I can't let her stay at Mount Wester.

40:19.590 --> 40:21.030
She must form her Golden Core as soon as possible.

40:21.590 --> 40:21.960
This way,

40:22.150 --> 40:23.230
the Soul-Devouring Lock won't have

40:23.250 --> 40:24.070
too much of an effect on her.

40:24.760 --> 40:25.590
After she completes her training,

40:25.960 --> 40:27.070
she'll have the ability to protect herself

40:27.280 --> 40:27.920
and pursue

40:27.960 --> 40:28.920
the life she wants.

40:30.760 --> 40:33.110
This isn't something that can be rushed.

40:33.360 --> 40:34.590
Besides, Ranran is still far from

40:34.620 --> 40:35.750
forming her Golden Core.

40:36.080 --> 40:36.600
It'll be possible

40:36.630 --> 40:37.670
if she can enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

40:38.030 --> 40:39.760
How many elite talents from various Heavenly Sects

40:39.760 --> 40:40.760
participate in the Marrow-Cleansing Conference?

40:41.070 --> 40:42.670
Only one person might be able to enter the Marrow-Cleansing Pool.

40:42.960 --> 40:44.480
They'll definitely use all sorts of tactics.

40:44.670 --> 40:45.920
Even if Ranran has the ability,

40:46.070 --> 40:47.150
she may not necessarily win.

40:48.760 --> 40:49.780
What are you pondering now?

40:50.190 --> 40:51.670
You should take it easy.

40:52.230 --> 40:53.070
Being too obsessive

40:53.070 --> 40:54.280
will only make your emotions unstable.

40:54.670 --> 40:56.000
If your Ice Lotus Technique breaks,

40:56.150 --> 40:57.360
you'll lose your Transcendence Realm power.

40:57.710 --> 40:58.360
Even if you find

40:58.360 --> 40:59.360
a way to enter the netherworld,

40:59.480 --> 41:00.510
you won't be able to seal the Spirit Spring anymore.

41:04.480 --> 41:05.510
Nothing can change

41:05.510 --> 41:06.110
my plan.

41:06.480 --> 41:07.590
Even if my Ice Lotus Technique breaks

41:07.760 --> 41:08.550
and I fall from the Transcendence Realm,

41:09.070 --> 41:10.440
I can still use my body to seal the Spirit Spring

41:10.840 --> 41:11.710
to prevent future troubles.

41:12.970 --> 41:13.890
So what you said before

41:13.920 --> 41:14.840
was all true.

41:22.190 --> 41:22.960
Xi'er,

41:23.920 --> 41:24.990
stop sleeping.

41:26.510 --> 41:27.960
Don't you like liveliness?

41:28.480 --> 41:29.280
Wake up quickly.

41:29.670 --> 41:30.880
I'll take you to the market.

41:31.480 --> 41:32.920
I'll buy you your favorite food.

41:38.400 --> 41:39.800
Please wake up, okay?

41:43.590 --> 41:44.230
Senior Gao,

41:44.630 --> 41:45.620
As soon as I built my Foundation,

41:45.710 --> 41:47.230
I started the furnace and refined this Foundation Stabilizing Pill

41:47.550 --> 41:48.360
for Xi'er to try.

41:49.360 --> 41:49.960
Okay.

41:58.190 --> 41:58.960
Ranran,

42:00.110 --> 42:01.960
you seem quite different after you built your Foundation.

42:03.230 --> 42:04.840
I feel like I've seen you somewhere before.

42:05.410 --> 42:05.810
Senior Gao,

42:05.840 --> 42:07.070
are you confused from exhaustion?

42:07.400 --> 42:08.120
I don't understand

42:08.150 --> 42:08.880
what you're saying.

42:10.070 --> 42:11.280
It's just that the current you

42:11.300 --> 42:12.010
reminds me of someone,

42:13.230 --> 42:15.150
but I can't quite put my finger on whom.

42:17.900 --> 42:18.610
-Xi'er.
-Xi'er.

42:18.880 --> 42:19.510
You're awake?

42:22.340 --> 42:22.710
Come,

42:22.940 --> 42:23.480
take it easy.

42:23.670 --> 42:24.210
Xi'er,

42:24.630 --> 42:25.400
are you alright?

42:26.840 --> 42:28.030
We're back at Mount Wester?

42:29.000 --> 42:29.860
Here, have some water

42:30.000 --> 42:30.590
to soothe your throat.

42:31.960 --> 42:33.330
Do you feel uncomfortable anywhere?

42:35.550 --> 42:37.330
You want to know what happened to us,

42:37.360 --> 42:37.780
right?

42:38.840 --> 42:40.190
To be honest, we're not sure either.

42:41.000 --> 42:42.120
That wave came out of nowhere.

42:42.150 --> 42:43.360
Master didn't say much about it.

42:43.900 --> 42:44.880
But the important thing is

42:44.880 --> 42:45.630
we're all fine now.

42:46.760 --> 42:47.710
There's also some good news.

42:48.570 --> 42:50.020
Ranran has successfully built her Foundation.

42:52.480 --> 42:53.150
Impressive.

42:56.760 --> 42:57.880
We've fallen behind again.

42:58.800 --> 42:59.630
Don't worry.

43:00.630 --> 43:01.550
You just focus on getting better.

43:01.920 --> 43:03.240
I'll practice hard with you.

43:03.760 --> 43:04.920
We'll try to catch up with her.

43:08.190 --> 43:08.920
Ranran.

43:09.660 --> 43:10.320
Ranran.

43:11.360 --> 43:12.000
Xi'er,

43:12.280 --> 43:13.000
you're awake?

43:13.880 --> 43:14.550
That's great!

43:17.060 --> 43:18.250
Here's a letter from the Alcohol Immortal for you.

43:21.410 --> 43:22.410
Come, have some more.

43:25.840 --> 43:26.510
Ranran,

43:27.040 --> 43:28.040
the runes you sent

43:28.070 --> 43:29.550
are the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.

43:30.110 --> 43:31.190
This is the very formation that the Heavenly Sects

43:31.190 --> 43:32.630
used to kill Mu back then.

43:33.330 --> 43:34.510
Who would dare use this formation

43:34.510 --> 43:35.760
to harm the people of Mount Wester?

43:36.410 --> 43:37.890
This formation is intricate and mysterious.

43:38.360 --> 43:39.550
Apart from the sovereigns of the Four Sects

43:39.550 --> 43:40.590
who set it up before,

43:40.800 --> 43:42.510
no one else should be able to master it precisely.
